{"id":"cdd1728c22275ffc","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-constructive-proof-theory.md","title":"Constructive Proof Theory","display":"thm-constructive-proof-theory — Constructive Proof Theory","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-constructive-proof-theory","aliases":["72-thm-constructive-proof-theory"],"display":"thm-constructive-proof-theory — Constructive Proof Theory","depends_on":["[[72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge]]","[[72-df-acceptable-numbering]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified","source_location":"Handbook VI §§1.2,1.4 print409–410,418–419/PDF421–422,430–431; V §3.2 print353–355/PDF365–367","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","proof_status":"source theorem statement checked; full proof not reproduced or machine verified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-constructive-proof-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-constructive-proof-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-constructive-proof-theory — Constructive Proof Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"494fa4cd0ce92258\" href=\"?note=494fa4cd0ce92258\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge\">72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bf141a6daa8808bc\" href=\"?note=bf141a6daa8808bc\" title=\"72-df-acceptable-numbering\">72-df-acceptable-numbering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Handbook VI §§1.2,1.4 print409–410,418–419/PDF421–422,430–431; V §3.2 print353–355/PDF365–367"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source theorem statement checked; full proof not reproduced or machine verified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-constructive-proof-theory-—-Constructive-Properties-of-HA\">thm-constructive-proof-theory — Constructive Properties of HA</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{HA}_{72}\">\\(\\mathsf{HA}_{72}\\)</span>、算术语言及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_N\">\\(\\vdash_N\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"494fa4cd0ce92258\" href=\"?note=494fa4cd0ce92258\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge\">72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline0=0\">\\(\\overline0=0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{n+1}=S\\overline n\">\\(\\overline{n+1}=S\\overline n\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,C\">\\(B,C\\)</span> 为该语言闭句，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(A(x))\\subseteq\\{x\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}(A(x))\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(D(x,y))\\subseteq\\{x,y\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}(D(x,y))\\subseteq\\{x,y\\}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\ne y\">\\(x\\ne y\\)</span>；代入均避免捕获。</li>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bf141a6daa8808bc\" href=\"?note=bf141a6daa8808bc\" title=\"72-df-acceptable-numbering\">72-df-acceptable-numbering</a> 中满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\Phi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\Phi)\\)</span> 的编号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\omega}\">\\((\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e(n)\\downarrow=m\">\\(\\varphi_e(n)\\downarrow=m\\)</span> 是该固定计算结构的图关系。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TotRec}(f):\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists e\\in\\omega\\ \\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\varphi_e(n)\\downarrow=f(n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TotRec}(f):\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists e\\in\\omega\\ \\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\varphi_e(n)\\downarrow=f(n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{HA}_{72}\\vdash_N\\exists xA(x)\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\exists n\\in\\omega\\ (\\mathsf{HA}_{72}\\vdash_N A(\\overline n)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{HA}_{72}\\vdash_N\\exists xA(x)\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\exists n\\in\\omega\\ (\\mathsf{HA}_{72}\\vdash_N A(\\overline n)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{HA}_{72}\\vdash_N B\\lor C\\ \\longrightarrow\\ (\\mathsf{HA}_{72}\\vdash_N B)\\lor(\\mathsf{HA}_{72}\\vdash_N C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{HA}_{72}\\vdash_N B\\lor C\\ \\longrightarrow\\ (\\mathsf{HA}_{72}\\vdash_N B)\\lor(\\mathsf{HA}_{72}\\vdash_N C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{HA}_{72}\\vdash_N\\forall x\\exists yD(x,y)\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\exists f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ (\\operatorname{TotRec}(f)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (\\mathsf{HA}_{72}\\vdash_N D(\\overline n,\\overline{f(n)}))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{HA}_{72}\\vdash_N\\forall x\\exists yD(x,y)\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\exists f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ (\\operatorname{TotRec}(f)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (\\mathsf{HA}_{72}\\vdash_N D(\\overline n,\\overline{f(n)}))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>闭句条件不可省略：带自由变量的可判定析取可以逐点成立，而两个开析取支都不普遍成立。末式是Church规则的句法形式，不额外断言标准模型中任意HA定理为真。来源为VI Proposition1.15的HA<em>闭合规则，HA</em>是HA的保守扩充（print411–412），故其在原HA语言的DP、EDN及Church规则结论下降到HA；完整源证明尚未逐行复核。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-constructive-proof-theory-—-Constructive-Properties-of-HA","text":"thm-constructive-proof-theory — Constructive Properties of HA","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge","status":"resolved","id":"494fa4cd0ce92258","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-acceptable-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"bf141a6daa8808bc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-acceptable-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge","status":"resolved","id":"494fa4cd0ce92258","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{HA}_{72}$、算术语言及 $\\vdash_N$ 使用 [[72-df-arithmetic-natural-deduction-bridge]]；$\\overline0=0$、$\\overline{n+1}=S\\overline n$。$B,C$ 为该语言闭句，$\\operatorname{FV}(A(x))\\subseteq\\{x\\}$，$\\operatorname{FV}(D(x,y))\\subseteq\\{x,y\\}$ 且 $x\\ne y$；代入均避免捕获。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-acceptable-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"bf141a6daa8808bc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-acceptable-numbering]] 中满足 $\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\Phi)$ 的编号 $(\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\omega}$；$\\varphi_e(n)\\downarrow=m$ 是该固定计算结构的图关系。$f\\in\\omega^\\omega$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{HA}_{72}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_N","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline0=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline{n+1}=S\\overline n","display":false},{"tex":"B,C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(A(x))\\subseteq\\{x\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(D(x,y))\\subseteq\\{x,y\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\ne y","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Acceptable}(\\Phi)","display":false},{"tex":"(\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e(n)\\downarrow=m","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TotRec}(f):\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists e\\in\\omega\\ \\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\varphi_e(n)\\downarrow=f(n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{HA}_{72}\\vdash_N\\exists xA(x)\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\exists n\\in\\omega\\ (\\mathsf{HA}_{72}\\vdash_N A(\\overline n)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{HA}_{72}\\vdash_N B\\lor C\\ \\longrightarrow\\ (\\mathsf{HA}_{72}\\vdash_N B)\\lor(\\mathsf{HA}_{72}\\vdash_N C).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{HA}_{72}\\vdash_N\\forall x\\exists yD(x,y)\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\exists f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ (\\operatorname{TotRec}(f)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (\\mathsf{HA}_{72}\\vdash_N D(\\overline n,\\overline{f(n)}))).","display":true}],"bytes":2367,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-203","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-constructive-proof-theory|thm-constructive-proof-theory — Constructive Proof Theory]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-203","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-constructive-proof-theory|thm-constructive-proof-theory — Constructive Proof Theory]]"}],"outgoing":["494fa4cd0ce92258","bf141a6daa8808bc"]}